<title>USA: N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>N.Y. metal futures opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York metals futures were called to open by traders as follows:</p>
<p>COMEX August gold - unchanged to off $0.50 an ounce</p>
<p>COMEX Sept silver - unchanged to up 0.50 cent</p>
<p>NYMEX Oct platinum - unchanged to up $1.00</p>
<p>NYMEX Sept palladium - unchanged to down $1.00</p>
<p>COMEX Sept copper - unchanged to up 0.50 cents a lb</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
